[{"code":"foreign_export_mismatch","severity":"error","span":{"file":"platform/Prog.beni","start":{"line":8,"col":13},"end":{"line":8,"col":16}},"title":"FOREIGN EXPORT MISMATCH","message":"`platform/Prog.js` exports `whisper`, which is not a `foreign` value of this module.\n\nA sibling JavaScript file exports exactly the `foreign` values its module\ndeclares — no more, no fewer (`docs/design/boundary.md` §4, check 2). One\nexport per foreign value is one node in the dependency graph per foreign value,\nwhich is what keeps elimination declaration-granular; an extra export is a node\nnothing can reach. Declare `foreign whisper : …`, or stop exporting it."},{"code":"foreign_export_mismatch","severity":"error","span":{"file":"platform/Prog.beni","start":{"line":11,"col":13},"end":{"line":11,"col":18}},"title":"FOREIGN EXPORT MISMATCH","message":"`platform/Prog.js` does not export `shout`.\n\nA sibling JavaScript file exports exactly the `foreign` values its module\ndeclares — no more, no fewer (`docs/design/boundary.md` §4, check 2). Add\n`export const shout = …;` to it, or delete the `foreign` declaration."}]
